    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42116" root="وعد" body-key="w">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِدِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>Of,</i> or <i>relating</i> or <i>belonging to, a promise:</i> rel. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِدَةٌ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنِىٌّ</span> of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنَةٌ</span>, formed
without restoring the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">و</span> like as it is restored in
[the rel. n. of] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيَةٌ</span>: [see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شيو</span>:] but Fr says
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِدَوِىٌّ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنَوِىٌّ</span>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِيَوِىٌّ</span>. (S, L.)

